  message: "gRPC/protobuf linker already exists at packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/linkers/grpc.py. It handles: proto service definitions, Python servicers/stubs/registrations, Go RegisterXxxServer/NewXxxClient/UnimplementedXxxServer, Java ImplBase/newBlockingStub, TS/JS clients. Creates grpc_calls edges between clients and servers. Resolves unresolved edges from Go analyzer. 105-repo bakeoff session (broad-20260308-031842) shows 0 critical issues. Repos with gRPC (istio, microservices-demo, jaeger, kong) all analyzed successfully."  # c13b
